    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just an \"emotion\" though. it's the patterns in the names and the dates... they line up perfectly with the old voyager logs. i've been trying to act normal, like everyone else, but it's getting harder to just be a regular person when i know i have a cosmic duty to prepare for the transition to mars. how am i supposed to handle people at work or in my social life when they have no idea who i actually am?",
